    "title": "Lexicographically Smallest Root-to-Leaf String",
    "category": "Trees",
    "difficulty": "Medium",
    "problemStatement": "Each node of a binary tree stores a lowercase English letter. Every leaf-to-root path forms a string. Determine the lexicographically smallest such string.",
